    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest? i dont think i can just \"rest\" through this. it doesn't feel like a slump, it feels like an ending. like the version of me that actually mattered is just... gone. everything else feels so hollow and pointless without that drive. what am i even doing just dragging out the days when there's nothing left to say?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
