      "content": "It is incredibly brave of you to articulate such a deep sense of meaning and exhaustion right now. However, the feeling that a story has reached a final, tragic end is often a symptom of intense distress, not an absolute truth. Please consider that life offers countless ways to redefine what \"meaning\" means, even if the passionate drive you once knew is quiet right now.\n\nIf you are in crisis, please use these immediate, confidential resources like the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline to talk to someone right now.",
